      "sourceTextSha256": "5359d78d99afc9573421ab5e2c16c6562421ff92187de175f11892febb911bb1",
      "text": "Day 2 · Each night of your stay includes two of the lodge’s standard activities, to immerse yourself in the nature and culture of the area: the Lamanai Maya ruins, one of the most impressive archaeological sites in Belize; Jungle Medicine & Village Life, discovering healing plants and traditional village life; a guided nature walk through the jungle; a sunset cocktail cruise; a spotlight safari at dusk to spot nocturnal wildlife; or a guided night walk through the jungle. (Meals: B, L, D)",
